{"id":"d58dd0007b8d1a35","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/897_RW_相关逻辑.md","title":"897 RW 相关逻辑","display":"897_RW_相关逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<h1 id=\"897-RW-相关逻辑\">897 RW 相关逻辑</h1>\n<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\mathsf{At}\\)</span> 为固定可数无限原子集合。公式构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}\\)</span>。其型别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>RW 在后文把 K 弱化公理加入 R 的蕴含片段。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式与替换\">2. 公式与替换</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 是最小集合，满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(A,\\sigma)=A[\\sigma]\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}(A,\\sigma)=A[\\sigma]\\)</span>，其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{and}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{and}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{or}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{or}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{or}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{imp}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{imp}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。定义绑定原子函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>固定新鲜原子选择函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任一原子重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{RW}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{RW}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由于没有绑定名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{RW}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{RW}}\\)</span> 均是捕获避免替换。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{RW}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{RW}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-公理族\">3. 公理族</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(B,C),\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\operatorname{imp}(A,C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(B,C),\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\operatorname{imp}(A,C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(B,C)),\\operatorname{imp}(B,\\operatorname{imp}(A,C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(B,C)),\\operatorname{imp}(B,\\operatorname{imp}(A,C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(A,A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(A,A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{W}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)),\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{W}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)),\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(B,A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(B,A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义合取、析取与分配公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land}=\n\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B),A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(B,\\operatorname{and}(A,B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land}=\n\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B),A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(B,\\operatorname{and}(A,B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor}=\n\\{\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{or}(A,B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{imp}(B,\\operatorname{or}(A,B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,C),\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(B,C),\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B),C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor}=\n\\{\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{or}(A,B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{imp}(B,\\operatorname{or}(A,B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,C),\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(B,C),\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B),C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{dist}}=\n\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{and}(A,\\operatorname{or}(B,C)),\\operatorname{or}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B),\\operatorname{and}(A,C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{dist}}=\n\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{and}(A,\\operatorname{or}(B,C)),\\operatorname{or}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B),\\operatorname{and}(A,C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{RW}}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{W}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{dist}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{RW}}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{W}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{dist}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-分离规则\">4. 分离规则</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Frm}^n\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Frm}^n\\)</span>。分离规则关系为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 的子集：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}=\\{((A,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B));B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}=\\{((A,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B));B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 K 与 W 的零前提规则层影响：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{K}\n=\\{(();\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(B,A))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{K}\n=\\{(();\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(B,A))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{W}\n=\\{(();\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)),\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{W}\n=\\{(();\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)),\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{RW}}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{K}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{W}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{RW}}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{K}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{W}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义证明步标签集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Lbl}_{\\mathsf{RW}}=\n\\{\\mathsf{hyp},\\mathsf{axB},\\mathsf{axC},\\mathsf{axI},\\mathsf K,\\mathsf W,\\mathsf{axLand},\\mathsf{axLor},\\mathsf{axDist}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathsf{mp}(j,k):j,k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Lbl}_{\\mathsf{RW}}=\n\\{\\mathsf{hyp},\\mathsf{axB},\\mathsf{axC},\\mathsf{axI},\\mathsf K,\\mathsf W,\\mathsf{axLand},\\mathsf{axLor},\\mathsf{axDist}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathsf{mp}(j,k):j,k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-证明序列\">5. 证明序列</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{RW}}(\\Gamma,A)\">\\(\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{RW}}(\\Gamma,A)\\)</span> 是所有二元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\pi,\\lambda)\">\\((\\pi,\\lambda)\\)</span> 的集合，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(F_0,\\ldots,F_{n-1})\">\\(\\pi=(F_0,\\ldots,F_{n-1})\\)</span> 是非空有限序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda:n\\to\\mathsf{Lbl}_{\\mathsf{RW}}\">\\(\\lambda:n\\to\\mathsf{Lbl}_{\\mathsf{RW}}\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{n-1}=A\">\\(F_{n-1}=A\\)</span>，并且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span> 满足下列分支之一：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{hyp}\\wedge F_i\\in\\Gamma,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{hyp}\\wedge F_i\\in\\Gamma,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axB}\\wedge F_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{B},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axB}\\wedge F_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{B},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axC}\\wedge F_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{C},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axC}\\wedge F_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{C},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axI}\\wedge F_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{I},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axI}\\wedge F_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{I},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf K\\wedge (();F_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{K},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf K\\wedge (();F_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{K},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf W\\wedge (();F_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{W},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf W\\wedge (();F_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{W},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axLand}\\wedge F_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axLand}\\wedge F_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axLor}\\wedge F_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axLor}\\wedge F_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axDist}\\wedge F_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{dist}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axDist}\\wedge F_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{dist}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>或</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists j,k&lt;i\\,(\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{mp}(j,k)\\wedge ((F_j,F_k);F_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists j,k&lt;i\\,(\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{mp}(j,k)\\wedge ((F_j,F_k);F_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-可导性\">6. 可导性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{RW}}A\\Longleftrightarrow \\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{RW}}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{RW}}A\\Longleftrightarrow \\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{RW}}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义证明证书集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{RW}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{RW}}(\\Gamma,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{RW}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{RW}}(\\Gamma,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{RW}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{RW}}(\\Gamma,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{RW}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{RW}}(\\Gamma,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-定理集合\">7. 定理集合</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{RW}}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathsf{RW}}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{RW}}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathsf{RW}}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-目标差异\">8. 目标差异</h1>\n<p>本条目的目标差异是：K 与 W 同时作为显式零前提规则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{K},\\mathsf{Rule}_{W}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{K},\\mathsf{Rule}_{W}\\)</span> 进入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{RW}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{RW}}\\)</span>，而语言不含融合构造子。</p>\n<p>RW 的公理差异对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf{RW}}(\\mathsf K)=1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf{RW}}(\\mathsf W)=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf{RW}}(\\mathsf K)=1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf{RW}}(\\mathsf W)=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{RW}}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Ax}_{B},\\mathsf{Ax}_{C},\\mathsf{Ax}_{I},\\mathsf{Ax}_{W},\\mathsf{Ax}_{K},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{dist}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{K},\\mathsf{Rule}_{W},\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf{RW}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{RW}}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Ax}_{B},\\mathsf{Ax}_{C},\\mathsf{Ax}_{I},\\mathsf{Ax}_{W},\\mathsf{Ax}_{K},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{dist}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{K},\\mathsf{Rule}_{W},\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf{RW}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{RW}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{RW}},\\operatorname{Sub},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{RW}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{B},\\mathsf{Ax}_{C},\\mathsf{Ax}_{I},\\mathsf{Ax}_{W},\\mathsf{Ax}_{K},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{dist}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{RW}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to},\\mathsf{Rule}_{K},\\mathsf{Rule}_{W},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{RW}},\\mathsf{Lbl}_{\\mathsf{RW}},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{RW}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{RW}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{RW}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{RW}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{RW}},\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf{RW}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{RW}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{RW}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{RW}},\\operatorname{Sub},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{RW}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{B},\\mathsf{Ax}_{C},\\mathsf{Ax}_{I},\\mathsf{Ax}_{W},\\mathsf{Ax}_{K},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{dist}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{RW}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to},\\mathsf{Rule}_{K},\\mathsf{Rule}_{W},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{RW}},\\mathsf{Lbl}_{\\mathsf{RW}},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{RW}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{RW}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{RW}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{RW}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{RW}},\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf{RW}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{RW}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只定义 RW 的句法证明关系；不含融合连接词。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"897-RW-相关逻辑","text":"897 RW 相关逻辑","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式与替换","text":"2. 公式与替换","level":1},{"id":"3.-公理族","text":"3. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"4.-分离规则","text":"4. 分离规则","level":1},{"id":"5.-证明序列","text":"5. 证明序列","level":1},{"id":"6.-可导性","text":"6. 可导性","level":1},{"id":"7.-定理集合","text":"7. 定理集合","level":1},{"id":"8.-目标差异","text":"8. 目标差异","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{At}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\ti